      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(7)>#content_main_masterCard_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_card_8>div:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_text_8>div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.36.mp4",
      "start": 427.82,
      "end": 433.7,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "index": "11.37",
      "text": "第4步",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(7)>#content_main_masterCard_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_card_9>#content_main_title_11>h3:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.37.mp4",
      "start": 433.7,
      "end": 436.8,
      "duration": 3.1
    },
    {
      "index": "11.38",
      "text": "畫面會顯示您即將認證的網上交易數目，請仔細檢查交易詳情，再點選「同意」以逐一認證每項交易。如您對此交易沒有印象，請點選「拒絕」取消交易。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(7)>#content_main_masterCard_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_card_9>div:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_text_9>div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.38.mp4",
      "start": 436.8,
      "end": 474.08,
      "duration": 37.28
    },
    {
      "index": "11.39",
      "text": "第5步",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(7)>#content_main_masterCard_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(4)>#content_main_card_10>#content_main_title_12>h3:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.39.mp4",
      "start": 474.08,
      "end": 477.18,
      "duration": 3.1
    },
    {
      "index": "11.40",
      "text": "使用生物認證或您的6位數字流動理財PIN認證第一項交易，然後返回商戶網站完成付款，或點選「檢視另一項交易」以認證下一項交易。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(7)>#content_main_masterCard_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(4)>#content_main_card_10>div:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_text_10>div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.40.mp4",
      "start": 477.18,
      "end": 509.56,
      "duration": 32.38
    },
    {
      "index": "11.41",
      "text": "常見問題",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(8)>#content_main_columnControl_6>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_8>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_heading_4",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.41.mp4",
      "start": 509.56,
      "end": 513.84,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": "11.42",
      "text": "甚麼是網上交易認證服務？",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_accordion_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advanced_expander_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#\\32 24950019__tab0",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.42.mp4",
      "start": 513.84,
      "end": 521.86,
      "duration": 8.02
    },
    {
      "index": "11.43",
      "text": "網上交易認證服務讓您以安全、方便的方式認證網上交易。在成功登入HSBC HK App，核對並同意交易後，即可完成支付。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_accordion_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advanced_expander_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>#\\32 24950019__panel0>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControl_8>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_11>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_4>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.43.mp4",
      "start": 521.86,
      "end": 548.22,
      "duration": 26.36
    },
    {
      "index": "11.44",
      "text": "我與商戶進行網上交易時，已經登入HSBC HK App。當我返回HSBC HK App時，我找不到任何確認付款指示。我怎樣才能同意付款？",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_accordion_1>div:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_advanced_expander_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#\\37 85505073__tab0",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.44.mp4",
      "start": 548.22,
      "end": 574.18,
      "duration": 25.96
    },
    {
      "index": "11.45",
      "text": "如果您收到有關交易的推播通知，請點選推播通知並按照指示確認付款。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_accordion_1>div:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_advanced_expander_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>#\\37 85505073__panel0>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControl_9>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_12>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_5>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.45.mp4",
      "start": 574.18,
      "end": 589.78,
      "duration": 15.6
    },
    {
      "index": "11.46",
      "text": "如您收不到通知，請登出HSBC HK App並重新登入，以檢視相關付款指示。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_accordion_1>div:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_advanced_expander_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>#\\37 85505073__panel0>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControl_9>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_12>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_5>p:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.46.mp4",
      "start": 589.78,
      "end": 607.12,
      "duration": 17.34
    },
    {
      "index": "11.47",
      "text": "請注意，您須於3分鐘內認證交易。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_accordion_1>div:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_advanced_expander_2>div:nth-of-type(1)>#\\37 85505073__panel0>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControl_9>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_12>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_5>p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.47.mp4",
      "start": 607.12,
      "end": 617.1,
      "duration": 9.98
    },
    {
      "index": "11.48",
      "text": "我之前於支援3D安全技術的商戶網站進行交易時，曾使用HSBC HK App認證交易。為何這次會向我發送驗證碼？",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_accordion_1>div:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_advanced_expander_3>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#-\\31 70206988__tab0",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.48.mp4",
      "start": 617.1,
      "end": 640.84,
      "duration": 23.74
    },
    {
      "index": "11.49",
      "text": "該服務可能暫時未能提供，原因可能是理財服務系統的定期維護或更新。為免影響您使用銀行卡消費，我們會向您的已登記手提電話號碼發送驗證碼以進行交易認證。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_accordion_1>div:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_advanced_expander_3>div:nth-of-type(1)>#-\\31 70206988__panel0>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControl_10>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_13>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_6>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.49.mp4",
      "start": 640.84,
      "end": 681.46,
      "duration": 40.62
    },
    {
      "index": "11.50",
      "text": "查看所有常見問題",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(9)>#content_main_columnControl_7>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_10>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_links_1>li:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_link_1>a:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.50.mp4",
      "start": 681.46,
      "end": 687.88,
      "duration": 6.42
    },
    {
      "index": "11.51",
      "text": "使用信用卡／扣賬卡前，多一分留心",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(10)>#content_main_columnControl_11>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_15>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_heading_5",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.51.mp4",
      "start": 687.88,
      "end": 698.18,
      "duration": 10.3
    },
    {
      "index": "11.52",
      "text": "如果我們發現您的信用卡／扣賬卡出現可疑交易，就會向您發送信用卡／扣賬卡可疑交易通知。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(11)>#content_main_columnControl_12>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_16>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_7>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.52.mp4",
      "start": 698.18,
      "end": 723.16,
      "duration": 24.98
    },
    {
      "index": "11.53",
      "text": "在HSBC HK App或電話短訊收到通知時，請先仔細驗證所有商戶的詳細資料、付款金額、貨幣及交易日期和時間，然後向我們確認交易是否由您本人授權即可。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(11)>#content_main_columnControl_12>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_16>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_7>p:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.53.mp4",
      "start": 723.16,
      "end": 756.14,
      "duration": 32.98
    },
    {
      "index": "11.54",
      "text": "信用卡／扣賬卡「可疑交易通知」怎樣運作？",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(12)>#content_main_columnControl_13>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_18>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_heading_6",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.54.mp4",
      "start": 756.14,
      "end": 767.56,
      "duration": 11.42
    },
    {
      "index": "11.55",
      "text": "香港滙豐流動理財應用程式",
      "selector": "#content_main_tabsHorizontal_1 .tab-widget-list li:nth-child(1) a",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.55.mp4",
      "start": 767.56,
      "end": 772.8,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "index": "11.56",
      "text": "雙向交易短訊",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(12)>#content_main_columnControl_13>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_18>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>section:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_tabsHorizontal_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(2)>a:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.56.mp4",
      "start": 772.8,
      "end": 778.52,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "index": "11.57",
      "text": "只要啓用接收推播通知，當我們偵測到您的戶口有異常活動時，就會向您發出彈出式通知。",
      "selector": "#content_main_richtext_8>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.57.mp4",
      "start": 778.52,
      "end": 797.6,
      "duration": 19.08
    },
    {
      "index": "11.58",
      "text": "點擊通知後，即可開啓HSBC HK App，並可在登入後查閱交易詳情。在確認交易是否屬實前，請仔細檢查商戶的資料、金額、貨幣、交易日期及時間。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(12)>#content_main_columnControl_13>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_18>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>section:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_tabsHorizontal_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#tab-panel-tab>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControl_14>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_21>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_8>p:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.58.mp4",
      "start": 797.6,
      "end": 830.16,
      "duration": 32.56
    },
    {
      "index": "11.59",
      "text": "我們亦可能會在您登入HSBC HK App後向您發出交易通知。與彈出式通知一樣，您可以點擊通知以確認交易，或按照通知上的指示致電聯絡我們。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(12)>#content_main_columnControl_13>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_18>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>section:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_tabsHorizontal_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#tab-panel-tab>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControl_14>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_21>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_8>p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.59.mp4",
      "start": 830.16,
      "end": 861.04,
      "duration": 30.88
    },
    {
      "index": "11.60",
      "text": "如您對此交易有印象，請選擇「是」",
      "selector": "#content_main_richtext_9>p:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.60.mp4",
      "start": 861.04,
      "end": 871.1,
      "duration": 10.06
    },
    {
      "index": "11.61",
      "text": "回覆通知後，請檢查交易是否成功。基於保安原因，您的交易可能會被拒絕。如被拒絕，請再次進行有關交易。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(12)>#content_main_columnControl_13>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_18>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>section:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_tabsHorizontal_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#tab-panel-tab>div:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_columnControl_15>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_23>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_9>p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.61.mp4",
      "start": 871.1,
      "end": 892.32,
      "duration": 21.22
    },
    {
      "index": "11.62",
      "text": "如果您不認得該交易或其資料有誤，請選擇「否」",
      "selector": "#content_main_richtext_10>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.62.mp4",
      "start": 892.32,
      "end": 905.34,
      "duration": 13.02
    },
    {
      "index": "11.63",
      "text": "我們會拒絕相關交易，並與您聯絡（香港時間每日上午9時 – 下午10時30分期間），了解詳情。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(12)>#content_main_columnControl_13>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_18>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>section:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_tabsHorizontal_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#tab-panel-tab>div:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_columnControl_15>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_25>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_10>p:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.63.mp4",
      "start": 905.34,
      "end": 925.2,
      "duration": 19.86
    },
    {
      "index": "11.64",
      "text": "您也可以在選擇「否」後，和我們聯絡，攜手打擊信用卡騙案。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(12)>#content_main_columnControl_13>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_18>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>section:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_tabsHorizontal_1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>#tab-panel-tab>div:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_columnControl_15>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_25>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_10>p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.64.mp4",
      "start": 925.2,
      "end": 938.72,
      "duration": 13.52
    },
    {
      "index": "11.65",
      "text": "在HSBC HK App上開啟推播通知",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(13)>#content_main_columnControl_24>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_43>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_heading_7",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.65.mp4",
      "start": 938.72,
      "end": 946.62,
      "duration": 7.9
    },
    {
      "index": "11.66",
      "text": "如果您已於HSBC HK App啟用接收推播通知功能，您將收到付款確認通知。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(14)>#content_main_columnControl_25>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_45>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_20>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.66.mp4",
      "start": 946.62,
      "end": 963.98,
      "duration": 17.36
    },
    {
      "index": "11.67",
      "text": "否則，請按照以下步驟在HSBC HK App中啟用推播通知：",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(14)>#content_main_columnControl_25>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_45>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_20>p:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.67.mp4",
      "start": 963.98,
      "end": 977.58,
      "duration": 13.6
    },
    {
      "index": "11.68",
      "text": "點擊選單圖示，然後點選頭像圖示。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(14)>#content_main_columnControl_25>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_45>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_20>ol:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.68.mp4",
      "start": 977.58,
      "end": 987.38,
      "duration": 9.8
    },
    {
      "index": "11.69",
      "text": "到「設定及喜好設定」點選「通訊喜好設定」。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(14)>#content_main_columnControl_25>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_45>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_20>ol:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.69.mp4",
      "start": 987.38,
      "end": 1001.28,
      "duration": 13.9
    },
    {
      "index": "11.70",
      "text": "開啓「銀行交易及服務」推播通知。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(14)>#content_main_columnControl_25>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_45>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_20>ol:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(3)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.70.mp4",
      "start": 1001.28,
      "end": 1009.22,
      "duration": 7.94
    },
    {
      "index": "11.71",
      "text": "使用信用卡／扣賬卡時，提高警覺性",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(15)>#content_main_columnControl_26>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_46>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_heading_8",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.71.mp4",
      "start": 1009.22,
      "end": 1019.4,
      "duration": 10.18
    },
    {
      "index": "11.72",
      "text": "確保網購平台安全可信",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedListElement_1>h3:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.72.mp4",
      "start": 1019.4,
      "end": 1028.98,
      "duration": 9.58
    },
    {
      "index": "11.73",
      "text": "網址應該以「https」開頭，網址欄亦會顯示掛鎖圖案。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedListElement_1>div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.73.mp4",
      "start": 1028.98,
      "end": 1042.92,
      "duration": 13.94
    },
    {
      "index": "11.74",
      "text": "以更安全可靠的方式認證網上交易",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_advancedListElement_2>div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.74.mp4",
      "start": 1042.92,
      "end": 1053.1,
      "duration": 10.18
    },
    {
      "index": "11.75",
      "text": "於支援有關服務的網上商戶進行交易時，您可以使用香港滙豐流動理財應用程式網上交易認證服務，更安全便捷地認證您的網上交易，毋須再以短訊收取一次性驗證碼。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(2)>#content_main_advancedListElement_2>div:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.75.mp4",
      "start": 1053.1,
      "end": 1086.34,
      "duration": 33.24
    },
    {
      "index": "11.76",
      "text": "清楚檢查一次性密碼短訊",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_advancedListElement_3>h3:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.76.mp4",
      "start": 1086.34,
      "end": 1093.78,
      "duration": 7.44
    },
    {
      "index": "11.77",
      "text": "每次向本行索取一次性密碼作付款之用前，您應仔細檢查商戶名稱、交易時間和金額，以確保交易正確，切勿只顧尋找六位數字的一次性密碼。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(3)>#content_main_advancedListElement_3>div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.77.mp4",
      "start": 1093.78,
      "end": 1122.58,
      "duration": 28.8
    },
    {
      "index": "11.78",
      "text": "定期查閱信用卡／扣賬卡賬單",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(4)>#content_main_advancedListElement_4>h3:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.78.mp4",
      "start": 1122.58,
      "end": 1131.06,
      "duration": 8.48
    },
    {
      "index": "11.79",
      "text": "定時登入香港滙豐流動理財應用程式，或仔細檢查您的信用卡／扣賬卡賬單及交易紀錄，並確保您授權所有交易。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(4)>#content_main_advancedListElement_4>div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.79.mp4",
      "start": 1131.06,
      "end": 1156.96,
      "duration": 25.9
    },
    {
      "index": "11.80",
      "text": "千萬不要透露敏感個人資料",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(5)>#content_main_advancedListElement_5>h3:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.80.mp4",
      "start": 1156.96,
      "end": 1164.16,
      "duration": 7.2
    },
    {
      "index": "11.81",
      "text": "無論優惠有多吸引，也切勿因此而提供個人銀行戶口資料。緊記，騙徒經常會冒認各大機構，利用釣魚短訊及電郵、假冒網站和偽冒電話誘使您交出敏感的個人資料（例如信用卡／扣賬卡號碼、CVC／CVV安全碼及一次性密碼）或者要求您點擊可疑的連結。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(16)>#content_main_columnControl_27>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_47>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_advancedList_1>ul:nth-of-type(1)>li:nth-of-type(5)>#content_main_advancedListElement_5>div:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.81.mp4",
      "start": 1164.16,
      "end": 1219.26,
      "duration": 55.1
    },
    {
      "index": "11.82",
      "text": "發現可疑交易，即通知我們",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(17)>#content_main_columnControl_28>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_49>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_heading_9",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.82.mp4",
      "start": 1219.26,
      "end": 1227.52,
      "duration": 8.26
    },
    {
      "index": "11.83",
      "text": "對某些交易紀錄沒有印象？不要慌張，您可以暫時封鎖信用卡／扣賬卡，同時再三檢查您的交易紀錄或向我們舉報可疑交易。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(18)>#content_main_columnControl_29>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_50>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_21>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.83.mp4",
      "start": 1227.52,
      "end": 1259.9,
      "duration": 32.38
    },
    {
      "index": "11.84",
      "text": "暫時封鎖信用卡／扣賬卡",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(19)>#content_main_columnControl_30>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_52>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_heading_10",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.84.mp4",
      "start": 1259.9,
      "end": 1267.34,
      "duration": 7.44
    },
    {
      "index": "11.85",
      "text": "如果您遺失信用卡／扣賬卡，或者懷疑信用卡／扣賬卡被盗竊或盗用，您可透過滙豐香港流動、網上理財應用程式或致電我們的客戶服務熱線封鎖信用卡／扣賬卡。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(20)>#content_main_columnControl_31>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_53>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_22>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.85.mp4",
      "start": 1267.34,
      "end": 1298.68,
      "duration": 31.34
    },
    {
      "index": "11.86",
      "text": "您亦可致電我們的客戶服務熱線報失信用卡／扣賬卡。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(20)>#content_main_columnControl_31>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_53>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_22>p:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.86.mp4",
      "start": 1298.68,
      "end": 1311.66,
      "duration": 12.98
    },
    {
      "index": "11.87",
      "text": "想知更多如何封鎖信用卡？您可以瀏覽滙豐香港網站 > 查看常見問題、表格及服務費用 > 信用卡／扣賬卡支援 > 報失或封鎖您的信用卡",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(20)>#content_main_columnControl_31>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_53>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_22>p:nth-of-type(3)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.87.mp4",
      "start": 1311.66,
      "end": 1340.72,
      "duration": 29.06
    },
    {
      "index": "11.88",
      "text": "舉報可疑狀況或交易",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(21)>#content_main_columnControl_32>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_55>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_heading_11",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.88.mp4",
      "start": 1340.72,
      "end": 1348.38,
      "duration": 7.66
    },
    {
      "index": "11.89",
      "text": "如果發現信用卡／扣賬卡出現可疑狀況，或者有未經您授權的交易，請立即向我們回報。",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1)>main:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(22)>#content_main_columnControl_33>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_columnControlColumn_56>div:nth-of-type(1)>#content_main_richtext_23>p:nth-of-type(1)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.89.mp4",
      "start": 1348.38,
      "end": 1367.32,
      "duration": 18.94
    },
    {
      "index": "11.90",
      "text": "滙豐環球私人銀行客戶(852) 2233 3033",
      "selector": "#content_main_richtext_23>p:nth-of-type(2)",
      "selector_en": "",
      "file": "11.90.mp4",
      "start": 1367.32,
      "end": 1380.16,
      "duration": 12.84
    },
    {
      "index": "11.91",
      "text": "滙豐卓越理財尊尚客戶(852) 2233 3033",
